    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isle of the Eagle is an open world Eagle flight simulation game that takes place in Alaska! In this game, you will:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore 3 Islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Complete mini quests!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fly high over the islands or dive into the water to catch fish!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover Treasure to unlock special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Earn hunting medals for catching and eating crabs, snow hares, and fish!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Encounter Alaskan wildlife (Grizzly Bears, Humpback whale, Polar Bears, and more!)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Be amazed at the beautiful graphics and Alaskan scenery!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
